 "words_heard": 212,
 "words": 216,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "I see the man whose way prospers, every scheme he makes goes right",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.84,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And the anger starts to burn in me and keeps me up at night",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 1.18,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "But the song is singing softly, do not burn and do not fret",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.85,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Dwell in the land and do what's good, his word will hold you",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.5,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Take your delight in the LORD",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.02,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And he will give you what your heart asks",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.92,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Commit your way to the LORD",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.97,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Trust in him, and he will act",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.75,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Be still before the LORD and wait patiently for him",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.89,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Like the morning breaking slowly over hills of grey and blue",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 1.0,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He will bring your righteousness to light and let it shine for you",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 1.02,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Like the noonday sun your justice will be plain for all to see",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 1.06,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So I lay my worry down and let him walk ahead of me",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.56,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
